{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "双赢模式下孩子解决冲突", "content": "一位家长担心自己孩子与任何人都会打架，但发现该孩子与讲师家孩子玩耍时不会打架；当两个孩子看起来剑拔弩张、要开始打架时，讲师家老大总能找到一个方法提供另外的解决方法，让双方都得到想要的。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["内在能力"], "tags": ["冲突解决", "双赢"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-ab3207daeb80-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-ab3207daeb80", "blocks": ["b00006", "b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-ab3207daeb80", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006", "b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-ab3207daeb80-c001:a007", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "案例展示双赢培养创造力", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "双赢模式下孩子解决冲突的案例展示了孩子在冲突中提出双方满意方案，是双赢培养创造力和变通力的具体例子。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-ab3207daeb80-c001:u0008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
