{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "双赢过程的两个问题", "content": "双赢过程有两个问题：1.时间长，需要父母很多耐心和时间，父母可能很忙很累，但前面先努力后面就简单很多；2.讨论方案时可能产生矛盾，双方生气。初始会不习惯，因为强迫和控制起效很快，但双赢比较缓慢。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["困难", "耐心"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-ab3207daeb80-c001:a024", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-ab3207daeb80", "blocks": ["b00020", "b00021", "b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-ab3207daeb80", "blocks": ["b00020", "b00021", "b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-ab3207daeb80-c001:a025", "kind": "supports", "condition": "双赢过程中的情绪困难", "reason": "双赢过程的两个问题指出讨论方案时可能产生矛盾、双方生气；双赢过程培养父母情绪肌肉指出这些情绪困难可以帮助父母练习应对情绪，两者相辅相成。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-07", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：双赢过程；候选指出时间耐心问题，对应 legacy 限制“双赢慢、要耐心”。", "reason": "补充双赢耗时需耐心的限制。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-ab3207daeb80-c001:u0024"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
